Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.80,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to {\c&H0000FFFF&}Matty Jacks{\c&H00FFFFFF&}. I am Renisa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:06.20,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,the team leader of the company,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:08.80,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,and we're building the future of web at the speed of thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:13.20,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,Traditional web creation is broken — it's slow, it's expensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:17.00,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,and by the time you launch, your idea is outdated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:21.50,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,That's why we shifted to an AI-first development approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:24.20,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,We call it {\c&H0000FFFF&}VibeCoding{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.50,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,We don't just type out syntax for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:31.00,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,We use state-of-the-art {\c&H0000FFFF&}agentic LLMs{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.20,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,to generate, debug, and patch complex web applications at real-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:39.50,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,With the guidance of our CEO {\c&H0000FFFF&}Matthew{\c&H00FFFFFF&}, our global team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:43.50,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,combines human expertise and AI efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:48.00,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,Whether you need a sleek landing page, a custom web application,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:51.50,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,or an automated setup,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:56.50,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,we turn your idea to production-ready platforms in {\c&H0000FFFF&}weeks, not years{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:01:00.50,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,Stop waiting for legacy development. Let's build your next digital asset today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:06.00,CommercialSub,,0,0,0,,Head on to {\c&H0000FFFF&}mattyjax.com{\c&H00FFFFFF&} and grab a dev contract.
